From 3cbb94ac12e290263a9253a84fd2d3f520174894 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 07:38:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] Page: warm and keep when Desktop is chosen, protocol 2
 stand-in host, address e2e

The page loads what a gone host could not give (the engine and speed test
scripts, the Setup plan, the screens a run opens) and keeps the chosen demo
site as soon as Desktop is chosen, not when the link opens: the host can die
before it does. The stand-in host speaks protocol 2 (a probe with no name, a
welcome with the name and cores), a typed address, a desktop that does not
let the page in, a version mismatch and a full desktop. New e2e for the typed
address, the Capacitor app, the two-step label, the planning text and the
host-gone gaps.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016zPE7K49ycKieo7wJdrBFN
---
