From 0e08ba0e37735f61064ece819ac1f6cae151c21d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 08:09:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] Page: keep the chosen demo site's photo too; the engine
 can be a blob worker in the specs

The 3-D view loads the site's photo as an image from the page's own origin,
which a host that died before the run started cannot give: the kept photo is
held as a Blob address and used first (ui/imagery.ts keepSitePhoto). The specs
count a blob worker as the engine (it starts from the kept script), and the
two long host-gone tests have 10 minutes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016zPE7K49ycKieo7wJdrBFN
