From a42a89914e74d67703a1702b56e63cd8aeb05f7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 08:18:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] Speed test fence: ui/desktop.ts may keep a copy of the
 worker script, nothing else

The fence said only the statistics screen and the test's own files may name the
speed test. A page that a desktop host serves keeps the worker's script in
memory so the test can still run when the host is gone; the fence now allows
that one file and pins that it takes only the script's address and
setSpeedTestWorkerUrl, never runs the test or reads a result.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016zPE7K49ycKieo7wJdrBFN
---
 src/ui/speedTest.deps.test.ts | 23 +++++++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 21 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/ui/speedTest.deps.test.ts b/src/ui/speedTest.deps.test.ts
index 1954d4b..3ab35f5 100644
--- a/src/ui/speedTest.deps.test.ts
+++ b/src/ui/speedTest.deps.test.ts
@@ -5,6 +5,8 @@
